1
00:00:39,400 --> 00:00:40,200
Shen Tianbai.

2
00:00:46,120 --> 00:00:46,920
Hello.

3
00:00:47,010 --> 00:00:48,080
You don't remember me?

4
00:00:48,080 --> 00:00:50,800
Who are you?

5
00:00:51,240 --> 00:00:52,040
I'm Lu Ye.

6
00:00:54,610 --> 00:00:56,140
Do you remember who you are?

7
00:00:56,320 --> 00:00:57,120
I...

8
00:00:59,160 --> 00:00:59,960
I am...

9
00:01:02,760 --> 00:01:03,560
I am...

10
00:01:05,920 --> 00:01:06,720
A wolf.

11
00:01:08,560 --> 00:01:10,020
Your name is Shen Tianbai.

12
00:01:10,160 --> 00:01:12,560
You're the youngest sheriff in Ningcheng.

13
00:01:14,570 --> 00:01:16,770
You are also the savior in their hearts.

14
00:01:19,720 --> 00:01:21,520
You are not a wolf. You are human.

15
00:01:24,800 --> 00:01:27,000
Have you really forgotten everything?

16
00:01:30,360 --> 00:01:31,280
Get away!

17
00:01:41,780 --> 00:01:43,060
Please,

18
00:01:43,200 --> 00:01:44,479
please remember!

19
00:01:46,090 --> 00:01:46,890
Please!

20
00:01:57,560 --> 00:01:58,759
I remember.

21
00:02:00,630 --> 00:02:03,100
[Eclipse in the Lost City] [Episode 23]

22
00:02:05,960 --> 00:02:07,220
You finally remember.

23
00:02:10,360 --> 00:02:11,160
It was you

24
00:02:11,720 --> 00:02:13,480
who turned me into this.

25
00:02:14,960 --> 00:02:15,720
I'm sorry.

26
00:02:16,100 --> 00:02:17,100
It's all my fault.

27
00:02:17,480 --> 00:02:19,320
I really regret meeting you.

28
00:02:19,440 --> 00:02:20,240
I won't...

29
00:02:20,840 --> 00:02:22,160
I won't give up on you.

30
00:02:23,030 --> 00:02:23,990
Never.

31
00:02:26,320 --> 00:02:27,440
I hate you.

32
00:02:28,720 --> 00:02:30,160
I'm going to kill you.

33
00:02:39,920 --> 00:02:40,720
Calm down.

34
00:03:00,880 --> 00:03:03,680
Thank you for helping me
with another experiment.

35
00:03:03,720 --> 00:03:06,180
The wolf transformation is simply perfect.

36
00:03:06,720 --> 00:03:07,580
I think

37
00:03:08,220 --> 00:03:10,350
you should have figured it out, right?

38
00:03:13,480 --> 00:03:14,320
I promise you.

39
00:03:14,880 --> 00:03:15,680
Good.

40
00:03:15,930 --> 00:03:17,460
Pleasure working with you.

41
00:03:20,440 --> 00:03:22,680
Waiting for you at Tianjiu Alley.

42
00:03:35,930 --> 00:03:36,660
Go!

43
00:03:37,890 --> 00:03:38,690
Don't move!

44
00:03:44,800 --> 00:03:45,480
Don't move!

45
00:04:38,560 --> 00:04:39,360
Young Master,

46
00:04:39,600 --> 00:04:40,760
don't blame yourself.

47
00:04:40,760 --> 00:04:41,890
It's not your fault.

48
00:04:42,600 --> 00:04:45,080
We are at the end of our rope now.

49
00:04:45,190 --> 00:04:45,850
No.

50
00:04:46,450 --> 00:04:47,580
There is still hope.

51
00:04:49,520 --> 00:04:53,120
Shen Tianbai will bring back
the antidote for the new wolf toxin.

52
00:05:00,880 --> 00:05:02,950
Hasn't Shen Tianbai already
transformed into a wolf?

53
00:05:02,950 --> 00:05:04,750
Has he regained his sanity?

54
00:05:07,020 --> 00:05:08,680
I read in the dean's paper that

55
00:05:09,320 --> 00:05:11,120
wolves have the instinct to hunt

56
00:05:11,420 --> 00:05:12,760
and to protect their pack.

57
00:05:12,760 --> 00:05:15,490
They discovered a phenomenon
in the experiment,

58
00:05:16,510 --> 00:05:17,670
called the imprinting effect.

59
00:05:17,670 --> 00:05:18,840
After a creature completely
transforms into a wolf,

60
00:05:18,840 --> 00:05:22,100
the first person it bites
is called the first blood source,

61
00:05:22,420 --> 00:05:24,680
who is very likely
to be marked as one of them,

62
00:05:24,680 --> 00:05:26,880
awakening the sanity
of the wolf-transformed.

63
00:05:26,880 --> 00:05:27,840
Besides that,

64
00:05:28,020 --> 00:05:29,070
familiar smells,

65
00:05:29,090 --> 00:05:29,690
touch,

66
00:05:29,720 --> 00:05:30,480
and taste

67
00:05:30,520 --> 00:05:31,520
will also help.

68
00:05:32,840 --> 00:05:34,370
I don't know if it will work.

69
00:05:34,790 --> 00:05:36,120
I can only take a gamble.

70
00:05:38,800 --> 00:05:39,960
The moment I saw him,

71
00:05:40,710 --> 00:05:41,510
I knew

72
00:05:42,380 --> 00:05:43,420
I won the bet.

73
00:05:49,320 --> 00:05:50,520
There is an antidote.

74
00:05:50,640 --> 00:05:51,650
I will find it.

75
00:05:55,920 --> 00:05:57,520
So you agreed to the director

76
00:05:57,550 --> 00:05:59,280
just to help him stall for time.

77
00:06:00,080 --> 00:06:01,960
But even if he gets the antidote,

78
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:03,840
how is he going to pass the message out?

79
00:06:03,840 --> 00:06:07,040
The director has once again tightened
hospital security and added guards today.

80
00:06:07,040 --> 00:06:08,830
Even if he can fight 10 men single‑handed,

81
00:06:08,830 --> 00:06:09,270
well,

82
00:06:09,600 --> 00:06:10,800
once he's discovered,

83
00:06:10,800 --> 00:06:12,120
I'm afraid it'll be too late.

84
00:06:12,120 --> 00:06:12,880
Don't worry.

85
00:06:13,840 --> 00:06:15,840
Shen Tianbai always keeps his word.

86
00:06:16,240 --> 00:06:18,440
He definitely won't break his promise.

87
00:07:08,670 --> 00:07:11,510
We misjudged him before.

88
00:07:12,040 --> 00:07:14,400
This man would rather die to trick us

89
00:07:14,430 --> 00:07:16,430
into keeping the experiment going.

90
00:07:16,980 --> 00:07:20,360
For a fanatical, paranoid,
and arrogant scientist like him,

91
00:07:20,360 --> 00:07:21,960
the only person he trusts

92
00:07:22,300 --> 00:07:23,740
is himself.

93
00:07:31,790 --> 00:07:33,630
The origin is the end.

94
00:07:38,850 --> 00:07:41,550
[Renji Hospital]

95
00:07:51,000 --> 00:07:52,280
Shen Tianbai!

96
00:07:52,960 --> 00:07:54,320
Did you kill the chief?

97
00:07:54,800 --> 00:07:56,130
Whether it was me or not,

98
00:07:56,280 --> 00:07:57,850
you should already know.

99
00:07:59,250 --> 00:08:00,230
Otherwise,

100
00:08:00,560 --> 00:08:02,890
you wouldn't have followed the director.

101
00:08:06,400 --> 00:08:08,280
I want to avenge the chief,

102
00:08:09,070 --> 00:08:10,620
but I don't know what to do.

103
00:08:12,020 --> 00:08:13,540
I'm so useless.

104
00:08:13,960 --> 00:08:15,820
There is someone who can help you.

105
00:08:16,490 --> 00:08:17,110
Who?

106
00:08:17,320 --> 00:08:18,120
Lu Ye.

107
00:08:19,120 --> 00:08:20,080
Lu Ye?

108
00:08:20,430 --> 00:08:22,830
The antidote for wolf toxin is actually...

109
00:08:25,640 --> 00:08:26,350
So,

110
00:08:27,320 --> 00:08:29,720
only he can save Ningcheng.

111
00:08:32,159 --> 00:08:33,820
What if he doesn't believe me?

112
00:08:33,840 --> 00:08:34,990
After all, I...

113
00:08:35,020 --> 00:08:36,059
I stabbed him.

114
00:08:36,080 --> 00:08:37,210
He will believe you.

115
00:08:38,159 --> 00:08:40,880
Because he knows I won't break my promise.

116
00:08:42,960 --> 00:08:43,549
Okay.

117
00:08:44,200 --> 00:08:45,920
Tell me what to do.

118
00:08:46,760 --> 00:08:48,360
Help me take something out.

119
00:08:49,680 --> 00:08:51,390
The director doesn't trust me now.

120
00:08:51,390 --> 00:08:52,030
I...

121
00:08:52,080 --> 00:08:52,920
Don't worry.

122
00:08:53,520 --> 00:08:54,360
You can do it.

123
00:08:56,500 --> 00:08:57,260
Tell me

124
00:08:57,320 --> 00:08:58,650
what you want me to take.

125
00:09:06,880 --> 00:09:07,880
Young Master Lu,

126
00:09:08,240 --> 00:09:09,170
do your job well.

127
00:09:09,640 --> 00:09:10,760
If you do well,

128
00:09:10,960 --> 00:09:13,090
the director will reward you heavily.

129
00:09:13,250 --> 00:09:14,890
But if you don't,

130
00:09:15,360 --> 00:09:19,280
you know better than me
what will happen to the Qingtian Gang.

131
00:09:20,600 --> 00:09:21,160
Yes.

132
00:09:23,280 --> 00:09:24,080
Let's go.

133
00:09:34,430 --> 00:09:35,230
Hurry up.

134
00:09:40,680 --> 00:09:41,600
Murder!

135
00:09:41,630 --> 00:09:43,120
Shen Tianbai killed someone!

136
00:09:43,120 --> 00:09:44,630
Help!

137
00:09:46,200 --> 00:09:47,040
Murder!

138
00:09:47,040 --> 00:09:48,700
Shen Tianbai killed someone!

139
00:09:53,640 --> 00:09:55,720
Shen Tianbai went berserk
while having his blood drawn!

140
00:09:55,720 --> 00:09:56,800
Didn't I tell you

141
00:09:56,800 --> 00:09:58,240
not to draw that much at once?

142
00:09:58,240 --> 00:09:59,360
A bunch of idiots!

143
00:10:02,370 --> 00:10:03,200
What are you waiting for?

144
00:10:03,200 --> 00:10:04,000
Give him a tranquilizer!

145
00:10:04,000 --> 00:10:04,640
Yes!

146
00:10:36,580 --> 00:10:37,780
Watch out, Director!

147
00:10:41,820 --> 00:10:42,620
Calm down.

148
00:10:43,550 --> 00:10:45,480
I didn't actually want to kill you.

149
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:47,920
Don't do this.

150
00:10:57,650 --> 00:10:58,430
What's going on?

151
00:10:58,430 --> 00:10:59,960
It seems to be the hospital.

152
00:11:52,400 --> 00:11:53,200
Shen Tianbai,

153
00:11:53,600 --> 00:11:55,060
I said you were the savior,

154
00:11:56,280 --> 00:11:57,940
and you actually believed it.

155
00:11:58,880 --> 00:11:59,680
As expected,

156
00:12:00,880 --> 00:12:01,680
only you

157
00:12:02,890 --> 00:12:04,690
could come up with such a method.

158
00:12:08,510 --> 00:12:09,990
I'll leave it to you,

159
00:12:13,200 --> 00:12:14,000
Lu Ye.

160
00:12:18,150 --> 00:12:18,950
You won.

161
00:12:25,210 --> 00:12:26,010
Leave the rest

162
00:12:28,460 --> 00:12:29,660
to me.

163
00:12:31,880 --> 00:12:32,680
I will

164
00:12:35,390 --> 00:12:36,430
definitely win too.
